# Let's Play a Game with delirium (CR 207.2c, 700.2): on turn 1 Black Lotus pays for a Wheel of Fortune that puts an Ornithopter
# (artifact creature), four Islands (land), the Wheel (sorcery) and the Lotus (artifact) into Bot1's graveyard: four types, so all three
# modes may be chosen. The Wheel also makes Bot2 discard its seven Islands and draw a Memnite and six Islands. On turn 3, with Bot2's
# Memnite on the battlefield and Bot2 holding its six Islands and its turn-2 draw (seven cards), the spell does everything in
# printed order: Bot2's Memnite (1/1) gets -1/-1 and dies while Bot1's own Memnite (1/1) does not, Bot2 discards two (7 -> 5), and
# Bot2 loses 3 life while Bot1 gains 3 (20 -> 17, 20 -> 23).

